{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>In the streets.</b> Rabbi Jonah said: ישתקשקון — they strike thigh against thigh." "<b>They dash.</b> The final letter is doubled, and the verb is doubled: ירוצצו נפשם, from the root רץ, and likewise: ויתרצצו הבנים."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {1 "Resolved the bare formula 'והפעל כפל' as referring to the verb being a piel/polel intensive (doubled) form; rendered the three scriptural Hebrew forms verbatim without gloss, as the root citation רץ makes the argument self-evident."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:34.652981220Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}